  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given a tree with NNN nodes (numbered 111 through NNN). There are KKK special nodes f1,f2,…,fKf_1,f_2,\\ldots,f_Kf1​,f2​,…,fK​ in this tree.\n\nWe define d(p,q)d(p,q)d(p,q) to be the number of edges on the unique path from node ppp to node qqq.\n\nYou are given a node aaa. For each node bbb from 111 to NNN, find the maximum value of d(a,u)−d(b,u)d(a,u)-d(b,u)d(a,u)−d(b,u) where uuu is a special node, as well as any special node uuu for which that maximum value is attained.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains three space-separated integers NNN, KKK, aaa.\nThe second line contains KKK space-separated integers f1,f2,…,fKf_1,f_2,\\ldots,f_Kf1​,f2​,…,fK​.\nN−1N-1N−1 lines follow. For each valid iii, the iii-th of these lines contains two space-separated integers uiu_iui​ and viv_ivi​ denoting an edge of the tree.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, print two lines.\n\n\nIn the first line print NNN space-separated integers. For each valid iii, the iii-th integer should be the maximum value of d(a,u)−d(i,u)d(a,u)-d(i,u)d(a,u)−d(i,u) where uuu is a special node.\n\n\nIn the second line print NNN space-separated integers. For each valid iii, the iii-th integer should be any special node uuu for which the maximum of d(a,u)−d(i,u)d(a,u)-d(i,u)d(a,u)−d(i,u) is attained.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤2001 \\le T \\le 2001≤T≤200",
      "1≤K≤N≤2⋅1051 \\le K \\le N \\le 2 \\cdot 10^51≤K≤N≤2⋅105",
      "1≤a≤N1 \\le a \\le N1≤a≤N",
      "1≤fi≤N1 \\le f_i \\le N1≤fi​≤N for each valid iii",
      "fi≠fjf_i \\neq f_jfi​=fj​ for each valid iii and jjj such that i≠ji \\neq ji=j",
      "1≤ui,vi≤N1 \\le u_i,v_i \\le N1≤ui​,vi​≤N for each valid iii",
      "the graph described on the input is a tree",
      "the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 4⋅1054 \\cdot 10^54⋅105",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask #1 (10 points):**",
      "T≤11T \\le 11T≤11",
      "N≤200N \\le 200N≤200",
